{"nodes":[{"id":"project-process-title","type":"text","x":0,"y":-690,"width":11000,"height":230,"text":"# PPJ PROJECT PROCESS MAP\n\nOne registered project = one process card. Read each card from business/data input through processing, human control and final output.\n\nSource: [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_PORTFOLIO_CURRENT_SNAPSHOT|Current Snapshot]] | Architecture: [[02_BA_Knowledge/Enterprise_Architecture/PPJ_Enterprise_Application_AI_Automation_Ecosystem|Enterprise Ecosystem]]","color":"5"},{"id":"project-process-reading-guide","type":"text","x":0,"y":-420,"width":11000,"height":300,"text":"## HOW TO READ\n\nTrigger / Input -> Data preparation -> Rule / AI / Automation processing -> Validation -> Human decision -> Transaction / Output -> Monitoring / Support\n\nCard colors: active delivery = yellow | production/support = cyan | external collaboration = red | closed/on-hold = orange. Delivery Stage is current state; it is not a process step. Candidate/discovery items are excluded until registration is approved."},{"id":"domain-4b28ecd47c6e0f","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"MERCHANDISING","color":"3"},{"id":"domain-summary-4b28ecd47c6e0f","type":"text","x":70,"y":50,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## MERCHANDISING | 4 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-58e869157cb41b","type":"text","x":70,"y":170,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:MER_CostingAgenticPlatform_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1|MER_CostingAgenticPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: DEVELOPMENT | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nGarment requirement + technical history -> Sew/Wash/BOM/Consumption/Similar-Style agents -> Costing Orchestrator -> cost and quotation package -> expert review -> MER quotation decision\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nIED, Wash, Technical and MER experts approve AI proposals before business use.\n\nOUTPUT\nReviewed costing / quotation package with confidence and traceability.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"process-d2b4943e216610","type":"text","x":1830,"y":170,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:MER_InvoiceDataRecheck_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/MER.CHICOS.INVOICE.RECHECK-AUDIT.v1.1|MER_InvoiceDataRecheck_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nCosting + commercial cost + invoice data + customer rules -> cross-check -> exception detection -> MER review -> correction / acceptance -> audit output\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nMER validates customer-specific rules and approves every material exception.\n\nOUTPUT\nReusable invoice/cost recheck result beginning with Chico's rules.\n\n[[03_Projects/MER.CHICOS.INVOICE.RECHECK-AUDIT.v1.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/MER.CHICOS.INVOICE.RECHECK-AUDIT.v1.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"process-45023d44276c38","type":"text","x":70,"y":660,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:MER_MarketIntelligence_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3|MER_MarketIntelligence_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: ANALYSIS | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nMarket + customer + competitor + product signals -> collect/clean -> analyze trends and opportunities -> intelligence summary -> MER review -> commercial decision\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nMerchandising validates signal quality and distinguishes evidence from assumptions.\n\nOUTPUT\nActionable market/customer intelligence for product and commercial decisions.\n\n[[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"process-fcac77f9a5a7e2","type":"text","x":1830,"y":660,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:MER_POCommit_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/MER.PO-Commit|MER_POCommit_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: CLOSED | Status: Closed\n\nPROCESS\nCustomer order -> scenario validation -> MER PO preparation -> manual exception handling -> WFX PO record -> completion/close\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nMER reviewed scenarios not covered by automation.\n\nOUTPUT\nClosed PO Commit history covering the validated customer scenarios.\n\n[[03_Projects/MER.PO-Commit/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/MER.PO-Commit/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"2"},{"id":"domain-304c7e34bf53ef","type":"group","x":3780,"y":0,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"FABRIC / TEXTILES TECHNIQUE","color":"4"},{"id":"domain-summary-304c7e34bf53ef","type":"text","x":3850,"y":50,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## FABRIC / TEXTILES TECHNIQUE | 5 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-00e44ec2627fc8","type":"text","x":3850,"y":170,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:CPD_VisualSampleDatamart_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/CPD.Datamart.v1.1|CPD_VisualSampleDatamart_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Support\n\nPROCESS\n3D samples + images + visual assets -> ingest -> tag/standardize metadata -> visual library -> image search -> user selection -> asset maintenance\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nCPD/3D Design validates asset quality, metadata and search relevance.\n\nOUTPUT\nSearchable 3D/visual sample library; separate from FD Fabric Datamart.\n\n[[03_Projects/CPD.Datamart.v1.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/CPD.Datamart.v1.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"process-85e5e0a555f741","type":"text","x":5610,"y":170,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:FAB_FabricDatamart_v2.2.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/FD.Datamart.v2.2|FAB_FabricDatamart_v2.2.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Support\n\nPROCESS\nFabric/hanger/material data -> Directus import/admin -> validation and correction -> fabric master + QR information/design -> attach/use on hanger -> search/support\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nFD users approve data corrections, permissions and QR usage.\n\nOUTPUT\nGoverned Fabric + Hanger + QR reference datamart.\n\n[[03_Projects/FD.Datamart.v2.2/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/FD.Datamart.v2.2/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"process-3c26130a6739dc","type":"text","x":3850,"y":660,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:PPJxNUNOX.ScanTrial -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxNUNOX|PPJxNUNOX.ScanTrial]]\n\nStage: ANALYSIS | Status: External Collaboration\n\nPROCESS\nFabric/garment sample -> scan/capture -> image-quality and metadata check -> digital-library ingest -> user evaluation -> partnership/implementation decision\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nBusiness and leadership confirm trial evidence before any commitment.\n\nOUTPUT\nEvidence for fabric/garment digitization and digital-library feasibility.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJxNUNOX/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJxNUNOX/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"1"},{"id":"process-1e6dff3455963d","type":"text","x":5610,"y":660,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:TD_TechnicalKnowledgePlatform_v2.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1|TD_TechnicalKnowledgePlatform_v2.1.0]]\n\nStage: UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nTechnical sources + documents -> ETL -> standardize keys/versions -> canonical technical model -> sync -> search, costing, pattern, wash and AI applications\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nTechnical users validate completeness, latest-approved version, permissions and reconciliation.\n\nOUTPUT\nGoverned technical knowledge backbone for downstream applications.\n\n[[03_Projects/TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"process-b09c2bcabc38e8","type":"text","x":3850,"y":1150,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:PPJxStratova.AI -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxStratova AI|PPJxStratova.AI]]\n\nStage: CLOSED | Status: Closed\n\nPROCESS\nHistorical vendor/use-case proposal -> technical and commercial evaluation -> PoC discussion -> management decision -> close -> retain lessons\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nLeadership controlled the historical go/no-go decision; current PoC stays in Discovery Register.\n\nOUTPUT\nClosed historical evaluation record without reusing it for the new discovery.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJxStratova AI/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJxStratova AI/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"2"},{"id":"domain-9b6711c7b5268f","type":"group","x":7560,"y":0,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"SOURCING / PURCHASING","color":"6"},{"id":"domain-summary-9b6711c7b5268f","type":"text","x":7630,"y":50,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## SOURCING / PURCHASING | 6 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-6b9eb00e1f82a3","type":"text","x":7630,"y":170,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:PUR_AdhocIndentSouth_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Adhoc Indent mien Nam|PUR_AdhocIndentSouth_v1.0.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Support\n\nPROCESS\nIndent input -> field and business validation -> prepare transaction -> submit to WFX -> confirmation/status -> exception handling -> operational support\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nPurchasing reviews invalid or changed inputs and WFX compatibility exceptions.\n\nOUTPUT\nStable South-region indent automation.\n\n[[03_Projects/PUR.Adhoc Indent mien Nam/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PUR.Adhoc Indent mien Nam/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"process-69715afff8eea9","type":"text","x":9390,"y":170,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation|PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0]]\n\nStage: DEVELOPMENT | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nPurchasing input + WFX master data -> business validation -> authenticated WFX API lookup -> create/update GDI -> WFX confirmation -> audit\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nPurchasing confirms controlled submission; errors and duplicates are routed for review.\n\nOUTPUT\nAuditable GDI transaction and dispatch status in WFX.\n\n[[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"process-2ec8831825e6ee","type":"text","x":7630,"y":660,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:PUR_HMLabelProcessing_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.H&M Label-O Processing|PUR_HMLabelProcessing_v1.0.0]]\n\nStage: ANALYSIS | Status: On Hold\n\nPROCESS\nCustomer/label input -> extract customer rules -> transform and validate -> Label-O processing -> exception handling -> business review\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nPurchasing decides whether a scalable rules model justifies reactivation.\n\nOUTPUT\nControlled label-processing result; currently On Hold for scalability/value.\n\n[[03_Projects/PUR.H&M Label-O Processing/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PUR.H&M Label-O Processing/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"2"},{"id":"process-4cdb7e84aa3764","type":"text","x":9390,"y":660,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:PUR_InventoryReport_v2.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Inventory Report|PUR_InventoryReport_v2.1.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nWFX inventory and purchasing data -> extract -> reconcile totals -> transform -> tables/filters/reports -> Purchasing review -> enhancement feedback\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nPurchasing validates totals, refresh timing and operational interpretation.\n\nOUTPUT\nOperational inventory visibility for purchasing decisions.\n\n[[03_Projects/PUR.Inventory Report/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PUR.Inventory Report/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"process-409252972c2e8b","type":"text","x":7630,"y":1150,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:PUR_MaterialAllocation_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2|PUR_MaterialAllocation_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nOC material demand + available stock -> eligibility check -> allocation proposal -> quantity validation -> user confirmation -> WFX transaction -> rollback/audit if required\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nPurchasing validates OC eligibility, partial allocation and exception handling before submit.\n\nOUTPUT\nControlled allocation of surplus material across eligible OCs.\n\n[[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"process-a6d155c9d7c2c0","type":"text","x":9390,"y":1150,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:SCP_SourcingChatbot_v2.3.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3|SCP_SourcingChatbot_v2.3.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nSupplier/material/sample data -> ingest and normalize -> index/RAG -> search and comparison -> grounded answer -> user feedback and quality monitoring\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nSourcing validates source data, answer traceability and production quality.\n\nOUTPUT\nOne searchable sourcing intelligence and chatbot application.\n\n[[03_Projects/SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"domain-298dff72dae23f","type":"group","x":0,"y":2440,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"WAREHOUSE","color":"1"},{"id":"domain-summary-298dff72dae23f","type":"text","x":70,"y":2490,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## WAREHOUSE | 1 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-44046cf68b8411","type":"text","x":70,"y":2610,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0|WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: DEVELOPMENT | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nAWB image + DHL email -> OCR/email parsing -> canonical field mapping -> confidence and validation rules -> human review -> canonical AWB record\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nWarehouse reviews low-confidence fields, tables, weight and units.\n\nOUTPUT\nValidated structured AWB data across image and email channels.\n\n[[03_Projects/WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"domain-67e5edf346b98e","type":"group","x":3780,"y":2440,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"PRODUCTION + WASH","color":"5"},{"id":"domain-summary-67e5edf346b98e","type":"text","x":3850,"y":2490,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## PRODUCTION + WASH | 3 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-f77acfe7c01cf4","type":"text","x":3850,"y":2610,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:PROD_HangingLineIoT_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1|PROD_HangingLineIoT_v1.0.0]]\n\nStage: DEVELOPMENT | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nHanging-line machines/sensors -> WISER / INA -> collect and normalize -> production KPI calculation -> dashboard -> line/factory review -> corrective action\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nProduction owners validate source reconciliation and KPI definitions.\n\nOUTPUT\nNear-real-time line visibility for output, efficiency and exceptions.\n\n[[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"process-a425f8ff24dc7d","type":"text","x":5610,"y":2610,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:WASH_COWASH_v2.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.COWASH|WASH_COWASH_v2.0.0]]\n\nStage: ANALYSIS | Status: External Collaboration\n\nPROCESS\nWash operations + machine/output data -> capture -> standardize -> KPI/delay/rework calculation -> dashboard -> owner review -> operational action\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nWash/Production owners must confirm source, KPI, access and technical direction.\n\nOUTPUT\nOperational Wash visibility if the paused scope is reactivated.\n\n[[03_Projects/PROD.COWASH/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PROD.COWASH/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"1"},{"id":"process-800833e789be5b","type":"text","x":3850,"y":3100,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:WASH_SamplingManagement_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1|WASH_SamplingManagement_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: DESIGN | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nSample request -> planning -> recipe/process preparation -> sample execution -> result capture -> evaluation -> approval -> history and attachments\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nR&D Wash users review results and approve the sampling outcome.\n\nOUTPUT\nGroup-wide controlled Wash sampling workflow and searchable history.\n\n[[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"domain-2d9a5f67e2bc45","type":"group","x":7560,"y":2440,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"QC / TQM","color":"2"},{"id":"domain-summary-2d9a5f67e2bc45","type":"text","x":7630,"y":2490,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## QC / TQM | 2 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-7626dd3f242791","type":"text","x":7630,"y":2610,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:QC_DefectDetection_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai|QC_DefectDetection_v1.0.0]]\n\nStage: ANALYSIS | Status: External Collaboration\n\nPROCESS\nInspection image + labeled dataset -> AI detection -> defect classification + confidence -> QC confirmation -> accept/rework decision -> quality metrics\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nQC/TQM owns labels, confirms results and approves operational decisions.\n\nOUTPUT\nMeasured defect-detection capability when dataset/resources are ready.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"1"},{"id":"process-309aebfe21a54f","type":"text","x":9390,"y":2610,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:QC_ThreadTraceability_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread|QC_ThreadTraceability_v1.0.0]]\n\nStage: ANALYSIS | Status: External Collaboration\n\nPROCESS\nRFID/thread identity -> scan/read -> link to production event -> build traceability chain -> connect quality/product record -> QC/customer business decision\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nQC, MER and factory users validate feasibility and customer value before PoC.\n\nOUTPUT\nThread-to-product traceability evidence if the business case is approved.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"1"},{"id":"domain-d75c3a221126a5","type":"group","x":0,"y":4880,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"LOGISTICS / EXIM","color":"3"},{"id":"domain-summary-d75c3a221126a5","type":"text","x":70,"y":4930,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## LOGISTICS / EXIM | 1 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-2025ae2368970f","type":"text","x":70,"y":5050,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1|LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.0]]\n\nStage: UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nExpense invoice + supplier/region data -> intake/OCR -> mapping -> validation -> tax and regional rules -> exception review -> processing/posting -> audit\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nLogistics/EXIM users resolve exceptions and approve region-specific treatment.\n\nOUTPUT\nValidated expense-invoice transaction with regional compliance evidence.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"domain-c87977174b8e1b","type":"group","x":3780,"y":4880,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"FINANCE / ACCOUNTING","color":"4"},{"id":"domain-summary-c87977174b8e1b","type":"text","x":3850,"y":4930,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## FINANCE / ACCOUNTING | 5 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-0d364cbbc88ec3","type":"text","x":3850,"y":5050,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3|ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Support\n\nPROCESS\nSupplier invoice + GRN/system data -> validation -> matching and business rules -> transaction preparation -> automated data entry -> target system -> exception handling -> audit\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nAccounting reviews exceptions and controls production support.\n\nOUTPUT\nAuditable supplier-invoice/GRN processing and system entry.\n\n[[03_Projects/ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"process-ae0f6b99dc99df","type":"text","x":5610,"y":5050,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:FIN_FinanceManagement_v1.2.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1|FIN_FinanceManagement_v1.2.0]]\n\nStage: DESIGN | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nWFX / DWH / Databricks -> source validation -> finance rules and Q&A -> OC exceptions + factory performance -> Accounting review -> Power BI / management decision\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nAccounting approves sources, thresholds, exception severity and reconciled results.\n\nOUTPUT\nTrusted finance control, exception ownership and management insight.\n\n[[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"process-272ccf386250f0","type":"text","x":3850,"y":5540,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:FIN_InvoiceDownloader_v1.2.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2|FIN_InvoiceDownloader_v1.2.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nSupplier/e-invoice portals -> authenticate -> download XML/PDF -> validate and merge -> save with structured metadata -> expose to Accounting/EXIM workflows\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nOperations reviews missing, duplicate, failed and credential-related cases.\n\nOUTPUT\nReliable invoice document/data acquisition with audit evidence.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"process-8a9168fa28231b","type":"text","x":5610,"y":5540,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:ACC_InventoryReport_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0|ACC_InventoryReport_v1.0.0]]\n\nStage: CLOSED | Status: Closed\n\nPROCESS\nInventory transactions -> extract -> quantity/value/period reconciliation -> Accounting report -> Accounting review -> close\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nAccounting validated the historical report and closure.\n\nOUTPUT\nClosed Accounting inventory-control report history.\n\n[[03_Projects/ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"2"},{"id":"process-2b1d446028fdc6","type":"text","x":3850,"y":6030,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1|EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1]]\n\nStage: CLOSED | Status: Closed\n\nPROCESS\nExpense invoice -> extract/map -> validate -> automated system entry -> exception review -> audit -> historical close\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nEXIM/Accounting reviewed exceptions; successor scope moved to LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.0.\n\nOUTPUT\nClosed predecessor history retained separately from the current project.\n\n[[03_Projects/EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"2"},{"id":"domain-b8be3d1264310c","type":"group","x":7560,"y":4880,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"ADMINISTRATION","color":"6"},{"id":"domain-summary-b8be3d1264310c","type":"text","x":7630,"y":4930,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## ADMINISTRATION | 1 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-1da5d1848e93fe","type":"text","x":7630,"y":5050,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0|ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nTravel request + travelers/plans -> approval -> trip and booking -> advance -> expense submission -> settlement -> close\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nManager/Admin/Finance approvals control request, advance, expense and settlement stages.\n\nOUTPUT\nTraceable end-to-end business-travel and expense record.\n\n[[03_Projects/ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"3"},{"id":"domain-f187928fdb223e","type":"group","x":0,"y":7320,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"HR","color":"1"},{"id":"domain-summary-f187928fdb223e","type":"text","x":70,"y":7370,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## HR | 1 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-4af0411d50a41f","type":"text","x":70,"y":7490,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:HR_EmployeeDataPlatform_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/HR.SS&PFD.v1.1|HR_EmployeeDataPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nEmployee/applicant data -> collect or extract -> required-field validation -> standardize/match/deduplicate -> HR review -> Employee Master or prefilled application -> downstream sync\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nHR controls identity conflicts, corrections, consent, permissions and final confirmation.\n\nOUTPUT\nTrusted Group Employee Master plus controlled applicant intake.\n\n[[03_Projects/HR.SS&PFD.v1.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/HR.SS&PFD.v1.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"domain-24f47d9d1eddb7","type":"group","x":3780,"y":7320,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"INTERNAL CHATBOT & AI PLATFORMS","color":"5"},{"id":"domain-summary-24f47d9d1eddb7","type":"text","x":3850,"y":7370,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## INTERNAL CHATBOT & AI PLATFORMS | 3 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-c0c4bf91a307a7","type":"text","x":3850,"y":7490,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:AI_ApplicationHub_v2.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1|AI_ApplicationHub_v2.1.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nUser access -> AI application catalogue -> discover/search -> permission check -> launch application -> usage and support feedback\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nApplication owners govern catalogue entries, access and support ownership.\n\nOUTPUT\nSingle internal access layer for approved AI applications.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"process-45cc90d70b5291","type":"text","x":5610,"y":7490,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:AI_PERRIPlatform_v3.2.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot|AI_PERRIPlatform_v3.2.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Active\n\nPROCESS\nUser question/request -> intent and permission -> agent/tool selection -> governed data/API call -> controlled answer or action -> audit and feedback\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nHuman approval is mandatory for sensitive or write/action operations.\n\nOUTPUT\nPermissioned conversational orchestration across PPJ tools and knowledge.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"process-78918fecb23805","type":"text","x":3850,"y":7980,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:PPJ.GLPI.Helpdesk.AI.Chatbot.v1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.GLPI-Helpdesk-AI Chatbot|PPJ.GLPI.Helpdesk.AI.Chatbot.v1.0]]\n\nStage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT | Status: Support\n\nPROCESS\nUser IT/ERP issue -> intent -> GLPI/helpdesk knowledge retrieval -> troubleshooting answer -> ticket/escalation when unresolved -> knowledge feedback\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nIT Helpdesk validates guidance and owns escalation and knowledge maintenance.\n\nOUTPUT\nFaster IT support with controlled handoff to human service.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJ.GLPI-Helpdesk-AI Chatbot/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJ.GLPI-Helpdesk-AI Chatbot/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"5"},{"id":"domain-87930187ecdadc","type":"group","x":7560,"y":7320,"width":3600,"height":2300,"label":"EXTERNAL COLLABORATION","color":"2"},{"id":"domain-summary-87930187ecdadc","type":"text","x":7630,"y":7370,"width":3460,"height":90,"text":"## EXTERNAL COLLABORATION | 4 REGISTERED PROJECTS"},{"id":"process-2a4195ec1486b7","type":"text","x":7630,"y":7490,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:EXT_AcademicCollaboration_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1|EXT_AcademicCollaboration_v1.1.0]]\n\nStage: DESIGN | Status: External Collaboration\n\nPROCESS\nPPJ business problem -> academic problem framing + dataset -> student/research prototype -> benchmark -> PPJ expert evaluation -> handoff or stop decision\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nPPJ owners approve scope, data boundaries, benchmark and production boundary.\n\nOUTPUT\nEvaluated academic prototype and talent/research collaboration outcome.\n\n[[03_Projects/PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"1"},{"id":"process-70da8ccbd655dd","type":"text","x":9390,"y":7490,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:AI.Automation.Workshop.202606 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/AI Automation Workshop|AI.Automation.Workshop.202606]]\n\nStage: CLOSED | Status: Closed\n\nPROCESS\nBusiness needs + participants -> workshop planning -> demonstrations and working sessions -> feedback/ideas -> action capture -> close\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nFacilitators and business participants validated takeaways.\n\nOUTPUT\nClosed workshop event and captured improvement opportunities.\n\n[[03_Projects/AI Automation Workshop|Project Note]]","color":"2"},{"id":"process-71bf489e533b7a","type":"text","x":7630,"y":7980,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:AI.Automation.Workshop.Analysis.202606 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/Workshop Analysis|AI.Automation.Workshop.Analysis.202606]]\n\nStage: CLOSED | Status: Closed\n\nPROCESS\nWorkshop notes + feedback -> consolidate -> classify themes/opportunities -> analyze value/feasibility -> recommendations -> close\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nAI/Automation team reviewed and prioritized conclusions.\n\nOUTPUT\nClosed workshop analysis and recommendation record.\n\n[[03_Projects/Workshop Analysis|Project Note]]","color":"2"},{"id":"process-213ae3192a19c7","type":"text","x":9390,"y":7980,"width":1700,"height":450,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_PROCESS:VITAS.Sharing.202606 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/VITAS Sharing|VITAS.Sharing.202606]]\n\nStage: CLOSED | Status: Closed\n\nPROCESS\nIndustry updates/cases -> prepare sharing content -> presentation/discussion -> networking and feedback -> lessons captured -> close\n\nHUMAN CONTROL\nParticipants validated relevance and follow-up items.\n\nOUTPUT\nClosed VITAS sharing event with retained knowledge.\n\n[[03_Projects/VITAS Sharing/00_Project_Home|Home]] | [[03_Projects/VITAS Sharing/03_Process/TO_BE_Process|TO-BE]]","color":"2"}],"edges":[]}
